'''Artillery Dummy''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in the [[Ranking Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Artillery Dummy
|image = E 681.png
|appearance = [[Arena of Power/Artillery Alley|Arena of Power]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy base can attack Cat Units in its range, with a slow attack rate. Because it is a base, it does not move. All of its attacks are basically an instant-kill, except against [[:Category:Cats with Metal ability|Metal Cats]] and [[:Category:Lethal Strike Resistant Cats|Cats that survive lethal strikes]]. Artillery Dummy is immune to all effects but [[Surge Attack|Surge]], meaning that you can rack up more damage against it if you wish to progress much more quickly, though beware its absurd range of 450, being able to wipe out nearly any unit with Surge.

==Strategy==
Basically any unit that it can outrange, it will kill. Therefore, the best way to counter Artillery Dummy is to use units that outrange it, or time your units so that they go directly before Artillery Dummy attacks so your units can trigger the next wave as fast as possible, as the boss wave knocks your units out of Artillery Dummy's range. Due to its much longer range and more than halved attack rate compared to the regular [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]], this one poses much more of a threat.

