==Trivia==
*In reality, Artillery Dummy's health is not infinite. It actually has 2,147,483,647 health but due to the time limit of the stage, it is not possible to defeat it without hacking.
**The reason its health is exactly that is because [[:wikipedia:2,147,483,647|2,147,483,647]] is the maximum positive value for a [[:wikipedia:32-bit computing|32-bit]] [[:wikipedia:Integer (computer science)|integer]], and going over would cause an [[:wikipedia:Integer overflow|overflow]].
*[[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|Hades the Deathdealer]] is able to tank a hit from this base if at level 50+54 or at level 54 with max health [[Talents]] and a Defense UP (M) [[Cat Combo]]. [[Hell Warden Emma (Uber Rare Cat)|Hell Commissioner Emma]] can also survive a hit if at level 60+58 with max health Talents or at 60+6 with max health Talents, a Defense UP (M) Combo and a Defense UP (Sm) Combo.

